<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Imperio '96 net down.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Imperio '96 net down.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 0.13 vs 0.8</p>
<p>Premiums</p>
<p>Life 25.467 vs 18.269</p>
<p>Non-life 62.46 vs 51.662</p>
<p>NOTE: Companhia de Seguros Imperio is a Portuguese insurer. Imperio said in a statement that it forecast net profit of 1.8 billion escudos in 1997 and of four billion escudos in 1998.</p>
</text>
